  "description": "纯 C# 高性能 MySQL ADO.NET 驱动，零第三方依赖，支持管道化批量执行、EF6/EF Core、NativeAOT 与 OpenTelemetry 链路追踪。Pure C# high-performance MySQL ADO.NET driver with zero third-party dependencies, pipelined batch execution, EF6/EF Core, NativeAOT and OpenTelemetry tracing.",
